<view class="page"><text class="kicker">DAILY CONTENT INTELLIGENCE</text><view class="page-title">流量参考</view><view class="subtle">保存可正常访问的小红书原笔记链接，只研究选题与表达规律，不复制原文。</view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title"><text>添加参考笔记</text><text class="pill">人工确认来源</text></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">笔记标题</text><input class="input" value="{{form.title}}" data-key="title" bindinput="update" placeholder="输入原笔记标题" /></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">小红书笔记链接</text><input class="input" value="{{form.sourceUrl}}" data-key="sourceUrl" bindinput="update" placeholder="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/..." /></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">可复用规律</text><textarea class="textarea" value="{{form.note}}" data-key="note" bindinput="update" placeholder="例如：标题冲突感、封面留白、项目细节顺序" /></view><button class="button" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="add">保存到今日研究</button></view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!references.length}}"><text class="empty-title">还没有研究参考</text><text class="empty-desc">添加真实的小红书笔记链接，为后续原创封面与文案积累规律。</text></view>
  <view class="reference" wx:for="{{references}}" wx:key="_id"><text class="ref-date">REFERENCE</text><text class="ref-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="ref-note">{{item.note || '等待补充分析规律'}}</text><button class="copy-link" data-url="{{item.sourceUrl}}" bindtap="copyUrl">复制原笔记链接</button></view>
</view>
